        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: The Day After, I Like to Rock\n- Places: Kansas, De Soto High School, K-10\n- Topics: television ratings, filming locations, recording locations\n\nFacts:\n- The Day After is a 1982 film that aired in 1983.\n- The Day After was the seventh highest rated non-sports television show.\n- The Day After featured K-10, a state highway in Kansas.\n- De Soto High School in Kansas is located off K-10.\n- The album I Like to Rock was recorded in Kansas.",
